==Notes==
* A high [[tumble]] skill reduces the need for this feat, as the tumble skill can prevent attacks of opportunity from moving in combat. However, the usefulness of ''mobility'' is not eliminated since there are other conditions that provoke attacks of opportunity. Furthermore, the [[armor check penalty]] makes achieving a high tumble skill difficult for characters who wear [[heavy armor]] and/or carry a [[tower shield]].
* The AC bonus does not count toward the +20 dodge AC cap.

